# Doco access credential. Mint this via:
#   - `doco login` (localhost-loopback OAuth, shell-capable agents), or
#   - the MCP tool `doco_authenticate` (device flow, chat-only agents).
# Both write back here automatically. Never commit this file once filled.
DOCO_ACCESS=

# Optional. Refresh token returned alongside DOCO_ACCESS on device flow.
# Not used by anything yet but stored for future refresh-token rotation.
#DOCO_REFRESH=

# Optional. OAuth client identifier from /oauth/register. Reused across
# device-flow runs so the second authentication skips registration.
#DOCO_CLIENT_ID=

# Optional. Override the Doco host. Defaults to https://doco.to.
#DOCO_HOST=https://doco.to

# Optional. Override the Doco handle. Defaults to the first URL found
# in .doco/connections.md, DOCO.md, or doco.md.
#DOCO_HANDLE=
